administration#:#adm_activate_db_benchmark_instant#:#Save Instantly###fau: extendBenchmark
administration#:#adm_activate_db_benchmark_instant_desc#:#Database searches are saved immediately instead of at the end. This enables long requests that end with a timeout or a storage overflow to be recorded.
administration#:#adm_db_bench_grouped_by_sql#:#Group according to SQL
administration#:#language_scope_file#:#By file
administration#:#language_scope_file_info#:#Exports all database entries to language variables that are contained in the uploaded file. This can be used in order to bring a local language file up to the current status of the database.
assessment#:#ass_campo_export#:#Export the results to enter grades in <i>campo</i>.
assessment#:#ass_campo_file_written#:#The result file for <i>mein campo</i> has been written.
assessment#:#ass_campo_matriculation_numbers#:#Student registration numbers
assessment#:#ass_campo_matriculation_numbers_info#:#Export the list of registered examination candidates from campo as an Excel file. Copy the student registration numbers from the file into this field. Each student registration number must be copied into a separate line. Generate the export file and open the exported CSV file in Excel. One line must be included for each copied student registration number and include an evaluation of the participants of this test. Copy the evaluations into the Achievement column of the file from campo. You can then re-import this file into campo for entering grades.
