assessment#:#err_cloze_not_numeric#:#You have entered text in a space that requires a numeric value.
assessment#:#fq_err_no_numeric_value#:#Please enter a numeric value or a fraction.
assessment#:#fq_formula_desc_additional#:#atan2(y;x)' is also supported in StudOn (please separate the parameters using a semicolon).
assessment#:#send_simple_results_body#:#%s\n\nName: %s\nStudent registration number: %s\nDate of test run: %s
