common#:#cont_zipped_html_info#:#You can also upload a zipped media package like that created by Camtasia. The package should include an index.html file, if not you need to select a start file from the files tab.  When creating a new package, please be sure not to use umlauts, special characters or spaces in the project or file name, as otherwise the package may not work after it is uploaded. <br /><br /><div class="alert alert-info">If you would like to upload a <b>video</b>, please minimize the file size beforehand. Instructions on how to do so are available at <b><a target="_blank" href="https://www.studon.fau.de/cat2891910.html">schnell digital!</a></b></div>
