common#:#sub_mail_request_autofill#:#The free places have been filled, but a decision still has to be taken regarding your application for admission (a place has been kept free).
common#:#sub_mail_request_crs#:#Your application for admission to the course "%s"
common#:#sub_mail_request_grp#:#Your application for admission to the group "%s"
common#:#sub_mail_waiting_added#:#You have been placed on the waiting list and will be notified if you are accepted.
common#:#sub_mail_waiting_autofill#:#The free places have been filled, but you will remain on the waiting list.
common#:#sub_mail_waiting_crs#:#Your registration for the course "%s"
common#:#sub_mail_waiting_grp#:#Your registration for the group "%s"
