exc#:#exc_grade_start#:#Start correction
exc#:#exc_grade_time#:#Correction period
exc#:#exc_grade_time_info#:#In an exercise with restricted tutor rights (see settings for the exercise), course tutors can only enter submissions and grades for this exercise unit as of a specific date.
