exc#:#exc_max_team_size_info#:#Leave the box empty if you do not want to set a limit
exc#:#exc_max_x_points#:#max. %s points
exc#:#exc_mem_delete_perm_failure#:#In order to delete submissions, you require permission to edit the settings for the exercise.
exc#:#exc_msg_authorship_statement_required#:#Please read and confirm the declaration of originality.
exc#:#exc_multi_feedback_by_submissions_hint#:#If you enter your feedback directly as a comment in the submitted files (e.g. with pdfs), you can also work with the archive under Download all submissions.
exc#:#exc_multi_feedback_by_submissions_warning#:#You have probably uploaded the archive provided under Download all submissions. Do the files contain your feedback, e.g. as comments? Then you can save them as feedback.
exc#:#exc_no_assignments_for_grading#:#No exercise units available for evaluation.
