fau#:#fau_my_modules_info1#:#This page shows your StudOn courses and groups associated with campo courses in a semester. For each course you can choose a module/area to which the course should be assigned in campo. The course will only be included in the transcript of records for a few degree programs if the status in StudOn has also been set to "passed". This will be shown this after selecting the module.###
fau#:#fau_my_modules_info2#:#The selection list contains all modules/areas of the course assigned to your degree programme. A tick (✓) means that the requirements of the module/area are fulfilled. A cross (✗) means that they are not fulfilled. You can only select such modules if there is no selectable alternative. Then, with the acceptance of your course registration, it was decided that the requirements can be ignored.###
fau#:#fau_check_failed_no_studydata#:#You cannot take this teaching unit as no degree program data are available for your account in the semester in which the teaching unit is held.
fau#:#fau_check_failed_restrictions#:#You cannot take the teaching unit as the following restrictions are not met:
fau#:#fau_check_failed_term_not_valid#:#No correct semester has been entered for this teaching unit, meaning that the prerequisites cannot be checked. Please contact the person responsible for the teaching unit for further assistance.
fau#:#fau_check_failed_but_request_with_modules#:#You can be included in the course upon request. When you select a module, it is added to your module plan once you are accepted onto the course.
fau#:#fau_check_failed_but_request_without_modules#:#You can be included in the course upon request. As none of the modules in the teaching unit match your degree program, it will not be included in your final academic record.
fau#:#fau_check_passed_restrictions#:#Your degree program meets the prerequisites stated in campo.
fau#:#fau_check_success_but_soft_failed#:#However, it does not meet the additional restrictions for the degree program defined in StudOn.
fau#:#fau_check_success_no_event#:#No teaching unit is linked to this course. No prerequisites for taking the course are checked.
fau#:#fau_check_success_no_restriction#:#No prerequisites are given in campo for this teaching unit.
fau#:#fau_check_info_failed_no_studydata#:#Not met: No degree program data available for the semester
fau#:#fau_check_info_failed_term_not_valid#:#Not met: No semester given
fau#:#fau_check_info_failed_restrictions#:#Not met
fau#:#fau_check_info_passed_restrictions#:#Met
fau#:#fau_check_info_restrictions_for#:#Prerequisites for %s
fau#:#fau_delete_course_blocked#:#The course is required for campo and cannot be deleted.
fau#:#fau_delete_group_blocked#:#The group is required for campo and cannot be deleted.
fau#:#fau_delete_info_campo#:#The list includes one or more courses for teaching units from campo. The link to campo is removed upon deletion. If a teaching unit is offered in the semester, StudOn creates a new course the next time it is synchronized (generally on an hourly basis). You can prevent that by deleting or canceling the parallel groups in campo. Wait another one to two hours. After that, you can delete the StudOn course without it being set up again.
