fau#:#fau_org_studon_roles_not_assignable#:#As no employees are directly allocated to this organizational unit, the roles <b>StudOn author/in</b> and <b>StudOn manager</b> cannot be assigned via the IdM portal. If you require such roles, please contact <a href="mailto:studon@fau.de">StudOn-Team</a>.
fau#:#fau_org_studon_author_assignable#:#The role <b>StudOn author/in</b> is assigned to all employees directly assigned to this organizational unit, but can be removed by the head of the organizational unit in the IdM portal under Managing teaching roles.
fau#:#fau_org_studon_manager_assignable#:#The head of the organizational unit can assign and remove the <b>StudOn manager</b> role in the IdM portal under Managing teaching roles.
fau#:#fau_org_studon_manager_ignored#:#The role <b>StudOn manager</b> in the IdM portal is ignored by StudOn at this high level. If necessary, check roles with all included organizational units and contact the <a href="mailto:studon@fau.de">StudOn team</a>.
fau#:#fau_org_studon_author_missing#:#The role <b>StudOn Author</b> has not yet been set up. Please contact the StudOn team <a href="mailto:studon@fau.de"></a>.
fau#:#fau_org_studon_manager_missing#:#The role <b>StudOn Manager</b> has not yet been set up. Please contact the StudOn team <a href="mailto:studon@fau.de"></a>.
