fau#:#sso_change_explanation#:#<p>Your IdM account is not yet linked to a StudOn account. However, StudOn has found one or more accounts that could belong to you due to name similarity.</p><p>Please select your account and enter the password for it. The account will be used in the Single Sign-On in the future and its permissions will be updated automatically.<p>If you are unsure or no longer know the password of your StudOn account, please click on "Cancel" and contact<a href="mailto:studon@fau.de">studon@fau.de</a>.</p>###
