fau#:#studycond_condition_info#:#If you have selected the joining procedure direct entry or password-protected entry, you can set the restrictions students have to meet on the different degree programs in order to join the course. Application with confirmation will then apply for all other users.
fau#:#studycond_condition_info_create#:#After setting up the course, you can determine degree program specific restrictions for direct entry or password-protected entry.
