fau#:#fau_your_courses_of_study#:#Your degree programs
fau#:#fau_read_only#:#write-protected
fau#:#fau_transfer_course#:#Transfer link to campo
fau#:#fau_transfer_course_message#:#Select a course to which the link to the teaching unit in campo should be transferred. <p class="small">You need to have write permission for the course and it may not already be linked to another teaching unit. After the transfer, it becomes the destination for the link from campo. The module allocation, prerequisites and dates then apply to the selected course and new memberships in this course are transferred to campo. Course administrators, tutors and members and any existing parallel groups of the current course will be moved to the target course. After the transfer is completed, the current course is taken offline and can be deleted.</p>
fau#:#fau_transfer_failed_same_object#:#You must select a course.
fau#:#fau_transfer_failed_no_course#:#The selected object is not a course.
fau#:#fau_transfer_failed_no_write#:#You do not have permission to manage members in the selected course.
fau#:#fau_transfer_failed_already_connected#:#The selected course is already linked to another teaching unit.
fau#:#fau_transfer_success#:#The campo link has been transferred. You are now in the selected course.<p class="small">If you wish, edit the title of the course, stop the registration procedure and put it online. If you have not deleted the previous campo course, you can reach it via last viewed. It is not linked to campo anymore. You can delete it if it does not contain any content that you still need.</p>
fau#:#fau_transfer_source_desc#:#The campo link for this course has been transferred to another course.
fau#:#fau_transfer#:#Transfer
fau#:#fau_transfer_selected_course#:#Selected course
fau#:#fau_transfer_assign_groups#:#Allocate parallel groups
fau#:#fau_transfer_assign_groups_info#:#Allocate each parallel group from the teaching unit to the selected course that is to be linked to campo. If the selected course does not contain enough groups, select move to move the parallel group there itself.
fau#:#fau_transfer_update_title#:#Edit title and description
fau#:#fau_transfer_update_title_info#:#The selected course receives the title and the description of the current campo course
fau#:#fau_transfer_update_group_titles#:#Edit titles and descriptions
fau#:#fau_transfer_update_group_titles_info#:#The selected groups receive the titles and descriptions of the parallel groups
fau#:#fau_transfer_delete_source#:#Delete current course
fau#:#fau_transfer_delete_source_info#:#The current campo course should be deleted automatically after its link to campo is transferred. Only use this option if the course does not already contain members or content.
fau#:#fau_transfer_move_members#:#Change classification of old members
fau#:#fau_transfer_move_members_info#:#The members of the selected course and its groups are classified as previous members. This means that they can still access the course (e.g. for exam preparation), but their places become free for new members. You can later remove previous members without campo receiving notification that they have left the course.
fau#:#fau_transfer_next#:#Continue
fau#:#fau_transfer_source_group_desc#:#The campo link for this group has been transferred to another group.
fau#:#fau_transfer_group_multiple_selected#:#This group has been selected multiple times.
fau#:#fau_transfer_groups_multiple_selected#:#The group allocation is not clear. Each group of the selected course may only be used once.
fau#:#fau_split_course#:#Split campo course
fau#:#fau_split_course_message#:#The parallel groups of the course are changed into separate courses. Their members and content are transferred. If the course does not have any content outside the parallel groups it can be deleted.
fau#:#fau_split_delete_source#:#Delete current course
fau#:#fau_split_delete_source_info#:#The current campo course should be deleted automatically after it is split. Only use this option if the course has no content outside the parallel groups.
fau#:#fau_split#:#Split
fau#:#fau_split_success#:#The course has been split.
fau#:#fau_solve_campo_conflict#:#Solve campo conflict
fau#:#fau_solve_conflict_message#:#<p><b>Several StudOn courses are linked to this campo parallel group, but only one is allowed.</b></p> <p class="small">Please select which course should be linked to campo. This course will then be linked from campo and its memberships transferred to campo. The other courses will be taken offline and their members and waiting lists moved to the selected course. This ensures that students can find the correct course.</p>
fau#:#fau_solve_connect_course#:#Link course to campo
fau#:#fau_solve_select_course#:#Select course
fau#:#fau_solve_this_course#:#This course
fau#:#fau_solve_members_waiting#:#Members: %s, waiting list: %s
fau#:#fau_solve_success#:#The conflict was solved. You are now in the linked course. Please check the members and waiting lists.
fau#:#fau_send_members#:#Transfer to campo
fau#:#fau_send_members_failed#:#There are no members that can be transferred to campo.
fau#:#fau_send_members_success#:#The members have been made available for campo. It can last up to an hour until they are included in the list of participants for campo.
fau#:#fau_send_members_exceptions#:#The following members cannot be entered in campo as they are not registered there:
fau#:#fau_campo_close_modal#:#Close###
fau#:#fau_module_expired#:#Module expired###
grp#:#crs_grp_info_reg#:#You can only become a member in one of the following courses:
grp#:#group_req_direct_studycond#:#Direct access (otherwise application for admission) for the following students:<p class="small">%s</p>
grp#:#grp_added_member#:#Accepted into group "%s"
grp#:#grp_added_member_body#:#You have been accepted into the group "%s".
grp#:#grp_mail_permanent_link#:#This message concerns the following group:
grp#:#grp_max_members_mode#:#Procedure:
grp#:#grp_no_list#:#Rejection
grp#:#grp_no_list_info#:#Once the number of members is exceeded, anyone else trying to register will be rejected straightaway.
grp#:#grp_pass_request_studycond#:#Access using group password (otherwise application for admission) for following students:<p class="small">%s</p>
grp#:#grp_reg_limit_reached#:#You could not be accepted, as the maximum number of participants has already been reached.
grp#:#grp_reg_limit_time_info#:#You can only join during a fixed time period.
grp#:#grp_reg_user_already_assigned#:#You are already a member in this group.
grp#:#grp_reg_user_generic_failure#:#You couldnt be accepted.
grp#:#grp_reg_user_on_waiting_list#:#You are already entered on the waiting list for this course.
grp#:#grp_type_info_create#:#<span class="alert">Superordinate administrators may still have access to it (see info page after setting up)</span>.
grp#:#grp_type_info_edit#:#<span class="alert">Superordinate administrators may still have access to it (see info page)</span>.
grp#:#mem_error_preconditions#:#You couldnt be accepted.
logging#:#log_error_message_send_mail#:#Please first try to repeat the action. Sometimes it helps to log out and back in again. If the error occurs repeatedly, please send the error code to  <a href="mailto:%s?subject=code: %s">%s</a>. Please also describe what exactly you wanted to do.
mail#:#mail_from_via#:#%s via %s
mail#:#mail_only_own_courses_info#:#Please only write to members of your own courses and groups.<br />Please only use the collective addresses of courses for important messages.</br >Everything else is perceived to be like spam.
mail#:#mail_pear_is_automaticly_switched#:#PEAR mail is automatically activated for e-mails to members of groups or courses in the event of local roles without unique names.
mail#:#mail_smtp_not_allowed#:#You can only write to users in the system, not to general e-mail addresses.
meta#:#meta_vhb_notice#:#Notice for vhb course administrators: Enter the LV (Lehrveranstaltung/teaching unit) number under keywords under the tab rapid processing. If the course is to used for several teaching units, you can enter several LV numbers as separate keywords or use the placeholder * for any additional characters in a LV number.
mob#:#mob_extract_preview_image#:#Create preview picture
mob#:#mob_no_extraction_possible#:#The preview picture could not be created.
mob#:#mob_preview_image_extracted#:#The preview picture was created from the video. Load the page with the video again to update the picture.
mob#:#mob_preview_image_upload_info#:#You can also upload the preview picture yourself under the tab Files. It must have the file name mob_vpreview.png.
news#:#news_enable_private_feed_info#:#Activates password-protected newsfeeds with non-public messages.  The password applies for the newsfeed for messages on your desk and for separate newsfeeds from other services on offer. If you change it, the feed URLs also change.
news#:#news_get_context_info#:#This newsfeed contains all messages from this context that have been classed as public by their authors. It is not protected by authentication.
news#:#news_get_feed_info#:#This newsfeed includes all messages for the services you have selected that their authors have classed as public. It is not protected by authentication.
news#:#news_get_priv_feed_disabled_info#:#Your private newsfeed is not active. You can activate it in your <a href=%s">"messages settings"</a>.
news#:#news_get_priv_feed_info#:#This newsfeed also includes messages that their authors have classed as private. It is protected by a password that you can set in your <a href=%s">messages settings</a>. Please replace the characters PASSWORD in the URL with your feed password.
news#:#news_get_priv_feed_passhash_info#:#You can use this address if your RSS reader does not support passwords. If you change your feed password in your <a href=%s">messages settings</a>, this link will also change. Please do not give it to anyone else.
news#:#news_get_priv_feed_passhash_title#:#URL of your private newsfeed (alternative)
news#:#news_notifications_public_info#:#If this option is selected, you can also receive messages from outside StudOn via your personal newsfeed. Please note that these messages are accessible without authentication.
news#:#news_nr_of_items_info#:#Number of messages reserved for an object (e.g. a file or a learning module) in the database. Please note that container objects such as areas or courses may contain more messages, as they also show the messages or their subordinate objects.
news#:#passwd_equals_ilpasswd#:#Please enter a different password from your StudOn password
ps#:#cleanup_rbac_log#:#Clean up permissions log
ps#:#cleanup_rbac_log_finished#:#Permissions log has been cleaned.
ps#:#ps_cdf_desc#:#Description
ps#:#ps_cdf_desc_info#:#The description is shown on the login page under the input field.
ps#:#ps_cdf_email_auto#:#Automatic notifications
ps#:#ps_cdf_email_auto_info#:#An automatic notification is sent to the e-mail address entered at registration. The first administrator found with notification is used as the reply address.
ps#:#ps_cdf_email_text#:#Text in e-mail
ps#:#ps_cdf_email_text_info#:#The notification e-mail starts with this text. In the text you can incorporate the reply address with [reply-to]. This is then followed by details of registration (course/group info, name and e-mail address of person registering, course-specific user data).
ps#:#ps_cdf_is_sub_field#:#Subordinated
ps#:#ps_cdf_is_sub_field_info#:#This box is assigned to a drop-down list. If it is marked as a compulsory field, this only applies to the selected option.
ps#:#ps_cdf_parent_field#:#Parent field
ps#:#ps_cdf_parent_value#:#Parent selection
ps#:#ps_perform_export_excel#:#Start Excel export
ps#:#ps_type_checkbox#:#Checkbox
ps#:#ps_type_email#:#E-mail address
ps#:#ps_type_email_long#:#E-mail address
ps#:#ps_type_select_info#:#NB: The options in the drop-down menu are allocated to other fields. If you have to change the order of the values, you must also adjust the subordinate fields accordingly.
registration#:#reg_choose_password#:#Choose a password for your new user account. It must be at least 6 characters long and must include at least one upper and one lower case letter, one number and one special character (_.+?#-*@!$%~/:;). Please remember this password!
registration#:#reg_code_description_info#:#The description is displayed under the title of the page.
registration#:#reg_code_last_used#:#Last used
registration#:#reg_code_title_info#:#This title replaces the page title for the registration form.
registration#:#reg_code_use_count#:#Used
registration#:#reg_code_use_limit#:#Usable
registration#:#reg_code_use_limit_info#:#Number of times code can be used. 0 means no restriction.
registration#:#reg_code_use_unlimited#:#No restriction
registration#:#reg_confirmation_link_successful#:#<br />You have registered successfully in StudOn. Now you have to activate your user account. You have just been sent an e-mail with a confirmation link. Please also check your spam folder for the e-mail. <br />Click on the confirmation link in the e-mail in the next few minutes to activate your user account. You will then receive a further e-mail with your login details. Once you have your login details, register on the <a href="%s">StudOn website</a> under local registration.
registration#:#reg_login_gen_first_lastname#:#Automatically (first name.last name)
registration#:#reg_login_gen_guest_listener#:#Automatically for guest students (ghs16frneuma)
registration#:#reg_login_gen_guest_selfreg#:#Automatically for guests who have registered themselves (gsr12345)
registration#:#reg_login_gen_manual#:#Manual entry
registration#:#reg_login_generation_type#:#Create login
registration#:#reg_login_generation_type_info#:#Setting login name for new user account.
registration#:#reg_login_is_generated#:#Your user name is created automatically and shown to you after registration.
registration#:#reg_mail_body_confirmation#:#Before activating your new user account, you must first unlock it. Click on the following link or copy it into the address line of your browser (check that no line breaks are included):
registration#:#reg_password_is_login#:#Your password is the same as your user name.
registration#:#reg_pw_gen_auto#:#Generated automatically and sent by e-mail
registration#:#reg_pw_gen_info#:#Setting password for the new user account.
registration#:#reg_pw_gen_login#:#Using login details as password (not sent)
registration#:#reg_pw_gen_manual#:#Enter manually during registration
registration#:#registration_code_optional_info#:#If you have received a registration code, please enter it here. The code determines the options available to you in StudOn. If you do not have a code, please leave the field empty. Next, click on register.
registration#:#registration_code_required_info#:#Please first enter the registration code you received. Then click on register to complete the registration.
registration#:#registration_code_update_header#:#Edit code settings
registration#:#registration_codes_info#:#You can provide a link to self-registration as follows:<br />{URL}studon_register (code is asked for beforehand)<br />{URL}studon_register_CODE (code included in link)
search#:#search_for_matriculations#:#Search for student registration numbers
search#:#search_matriculations#:#Student registration numbers
search#:#search_matriculations_info#:#Enter the numbers separated by comma, semicolon or line break. Spaces are ignored.
search#:#search_use_quotes_info#:#Use inverted commas for terms that belong together, e.g.<br />"First steps"
style#:#sty_custom_css#:#Special styles
style#:#sty_custom_css_color_info#:#Defined colors are given according to the style forms, e.g. Color: !MeineFarbe(20);
style#:#sty_custom_css_description#:#You can enter special style settings here using CSS codes. The code is attached to the generated CSS file. Special styles only work in StudOn, not in the standard ILIAS program.
style#:#sty_custom_css_edit#:#Edit special styles
style#:#sty_custom_css_image_info#:#Images are referenced with an initial !, e.g. background-image: url(!MeinHintergrund.png);
style#:#sty_inherit#:#Set as standard
style#:#sty_inherit_info#:#This style is used for all sub-objects that have not selected their own style.
style#:#sty_inherited_from#:#Standard set by
style#:#sty_inherited_from_info#:#The standard style is set in the selected parent object.
survey#:#anonymize_survey_description#:#Anonymization removes all personal data from the survey statistics<ul><li>For public surveys using CAPTCHA, a small image text must be recognized before starting in order to prevent programs from completing the survey.</li><li>In the case of public surveys protected with an access code, a five digit access code distributed beforehand must first be entered  .</li></ul>Registered StudOn users do not require CAPTCHA or an access code.
survey#:#anonymize_with_captcha#:#Anonymous survey using CAPTCHA
survey#:#anonymize_with_captcha_info#:#The survey can be started by anonymous users after manually entering characters from a generated image. This option cannot be combined with an access code.
trac#:#lp_info_users_to_refresh#:#The learning progress of %s users has been updated. The learning progress of %users must still be updated. Please reload the page if necessary.
trac#:#trac_mode_questions#:#Number of correctly answered questions
trac#:#trac_mode_questions_info#:#Users who have correctly answered a percentage of the questions automatically receive the status processed. Please only use this option if there actually are questions in the learning module.
trac#:#trac_mode_questions_percent#:#Percentage (%)
trac#:#trac_required_questions_percent#:#Percentage of correctly answered questions (%)
user#:#browser_agent#:#Browser family
user#:#browser_desc#:#Browser description
user#:#browser_platform#:#Operating system
user#:#browser_version#:#Browser version
user#:#confirm_password_assistance#:#Would you like to send a link to change your password to %s? You will then be logged out.
user#:#current_password_info#:#<strong>Note for vhb students:</strong> Your StudOn password is not the same as the password for the vhb portal! If you do not yet know your StudOn password, select the function Forgotten your password? above. You will then receive an e-mail with a link that you can use to set your new password. If you cannot find the e-mail, please check the spam folder in your e-mail inbox.
user#:#idle_ext_account#:#Inactive IDM Account###
user#:#idle_ext_account_info#:#IDM account to which the user account is no longer connected (e.g. after exmatriculation) or is not yet connected (e.g. for pre-registered students). As soon as a single sign-on is made with this ID, the account is connected to it and switched to "Shibboleth".###
user#:#is_mobile#:#Mobil
user#:#show_client_info#:#Browser information
user#:#user_screen_reader_optimization_info#:#Adjusts StudOn for use with a screenreader.
user#:#usr_public_profile_global_alert#:#Your personal profile is visible to anyone using the internet!<br /><a href="%s">Change settings</a>
user#:#usr_public_profile_logged_in_alert#:#Your personal profile is visible to registered users!<br /><a href="%s">Change settings</a>
videoportal#:#vp_access_granted#:#Access is granted via a StudOn object.
videoportal#:#vp_authorization_failed#:#Authentication of video portal failed.
videoportal#:#vp_no_access_granted#:#User denied access.
videoportal#:#vp_no_interface_active#:#The StudOn interface to the video portal is currently not active.
videoportal#:#vp_no_reference_found#:#No reference was found to the clip or course.
videoportal#:#vp_no_user_found#:#No StudOn user was found corresponding to the IdM user.
pwassist#:#pwassist_enter_username_and_email#:#Enter a user name and the corresponding e-mail address and click on send.<br/>StudOn will send an e-mail to this address. The e-mail includes an address to a website where you can enter a new password for the user account. Please also check your spam folder, as the e-mails from passport support occasionally land there.<br/>If you are unable to set a password using this function, please inform your course coordinator or send an e-mail to studon@fau.de.
trac#:#trac_export#:#Export
trac#:#trac_export_title#:#Export learning progress
trac#:#trac_lp_matriculation_numbers_info#:#Please enter the student registration numbers for which you would like to export the learning progress (one student registration number per line). <br/> By clicking on the export button, a csv file is generated with the following columns:<br/><ul><li>Student registration number</li><li>User name</li><li>First name</li><li>Last name</li><li>Grade</li><li>Status code (values: 0 = not yet processed, 1 = Being processed, 2 = Processed, 3 = Failed)</li><li>Status name</li></ul>.
trac#:#trac_lp_matriculation_numbers#:#Student registration number
trac#:#trac_create_export_file#:#Download export file
crs#:#crs_selected_members_set_to_passed#:#Selected members set to Passed.###fau: PassedFlagCG - Bulk set members to passed
crs#:#crs_bulk_set_passed_flag#:#Set to Passed###fau: PassedFlagCG - Bulk set members to passed
grp#:#grp_selected_members_set_to_passed#:#Selected members set to Passed.###fau: PassedFlagCG - Bulk set members to passed
grp#:#grp_bulk_set_passed_flag#:#Set to Passed###fau: PassedFlagCG - Bulk set members to passed
